# The operations docs stay out of the repository. This one is public, and
# between them info.md, deployguide.md and workflow.md carried the cPanel and
# FTP passwords, the mailbox password and a live GitHub token in plain text.
# Only token.txt was withheld before, because push protection rejects a commit
# containing a raw token — the passwords it does not scan for went up freely.
/MD file/

# Source video masters: 50 Mbps phone footage, well past GitHub's 100 MB file
# limit. Only the web encodes in public/videos/ are needed to build or deploy.
Asset Drop/**/*.mp4
Asset Drop/**/*.mov
Asset Drop/**/*.mp3
